      <TableCell>componentName is a required field that specifies the name of the platform component using the identity provider as an authentication mode. It is used in combination with componentNamespace as a unique identifier. componentName must not be an empty string ("") and must not exceed 256 characters in length.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
